[299.16274, "o", "   109\t\t\t// 1. If both values are zero (within absolute tolerance), they match.\r\n   110\t\t\t// 2. Otherwise, check both absolute and relative tolerance:\r\n   111\t\t\t//    |a - b| <= tol.Absolute  OR  |a - b| / max(|a|, |b|) <= tol.Relative\r\n   112\t\t\t// 3. Handle NaN and Inf specially: NaN matches NaN, Inf matches Inf.\r\n   113\t\t\tresult.Match = false\r\n   114\t\t\tresult.Summary = \"tolerance comparison not yet implemented\"\r\n   115\t\t}\r\n   116\t\r\n   117\t\t"]
