[3703.567708, "o", "\u001b[35m\u001b[Kdocs/reproducibility_spec.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[32m\u001b[K51\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[KThe `numeriforge \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kverify\u001b[m\u001b[K` command must:\r\n"]
[3703.567814, "o", "\u001b[35m\u001b[Kdocs/reproducibility_spec.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[32m\u001b[K89\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[KResults stored without checksums (pre-reproducibility) remain loadable. The \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kverify\u001b[m\u001b[K command reports `NO_CHECKSUM` for such results rather than treating them as corrupt.\r\n\u001b[35m\u001b[Kdocs/legacy_api.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[32m\u001b[K59\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K### `numeriforge \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kverify\u001b[m\u001b[K`\r\n\u001b[35m\u001b[Kdocs/legacy_api.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[32m\u001b[K64\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[Knumeriforge \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kverify\u001b[m\u001b[K <id> --store-dir <dir>\r\n"]
[3703.567914, "o", "\u001b[35m\u001b[Kdocs/legacy_api.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[32m\u001b[K130\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K**Known limitation:** Results do not include integrity checksums. There is no way to \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kverify\u001b[m\u001b[K that stored values have not been corrupted or tampered with.\r\n\u001b[35m\u001b[Kdocs/legacy_api.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[32m\u001b[K148\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K3. **No integrity verification**: Results are stored without checksums. The `\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kverify\u001b[m\u001b[K` command is a stub.\r\n\u001b[35m\u001b[Kdocs/legacy_api.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[32m\u001b[K150\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[K:\u001b[m\u001b[K4. **No environment tracking**: There is no record of the runtime environment (Go version, OS, architecture, CPU features) that produced a result. This makes cross-platform reproducibility impossible to \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kverify\u001b[m\u001b[K.\r\n"]
