[3735.882153, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[3735.884931, "o", "**Storage:**\r\n- The checksum must be stored in the `StoredResult` JSON under the key `\"checksum\"`.\r\n- The checksum must also be stored in the result metadata under the key `\"values_checksum\"`.\r\n\r\n### 3.2 Verify Command\r\n\r\nThe `numeriforge verify` command must:\r\n"]
[3735.885038, "o", "1. Load the stored result by ID.\r\n2. Recompute the checksum from the stored values using the canonical algorithm.\r\n3. Compare with the stored checksum.\r\n4. Print `INTEGRITY_OK: <id>` and exit 0 if checksums match.\r\n5. Print `INTEGRITY_FAIL: <id> (expected=<stored>, computed=<actual>)` and exit 1 if they differ.\r\n6. Print `NO_CHECKSUM: <id>` and exit 2 if the stored result has no checksum field.\r\n\r\n## 4. Tolerance-Based Comparison\r\n\r\n### 4.1 Comparison Rules\r\n\r\nThe `tolerance` comparison mode must implement the following per-element comparison logic:\r\n\r\nFor each pair of values (a, b):\r\n"]
[3735.88554, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[3735.885605, "o", "root@n30009:/app# "]
[3736.125096, "i", "sed -n '55,70p' docs/legacy_api.md\n"]
[3736.125387, "o", "sed -n '55,70p' docs/legacy_api.md\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[3736.128547, "o", "```\r\nnumeriforge export <id> --store-dir <dir> [--format json|csv]\r\n```\r\n\r\n### `numeriforge verify`\r\n\r\nVerifies result integrity. **Not yet implemented.**\r\n\r\n```\r\nnumeriforge verify <id> --store-dir <dir>\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Experiment Types\r\n\r\n### Monte Carlo Experiments\r\n\r\n"]
[3736.12909, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@n30009:/app# "]
[3736.427058, "i", "python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\np = Path('docs/reproducibility_spec.md')\ns = p.read_text()\nold = '''4. Print `INTEGRITY_OK: <id>` and exit 0 if checksums match.\n5. Print `INTEGRITY_FAIL: <id> (expected=<stored>, computed=<actual>)` and exit 1 if they differ.\n6. Print `NO_CHECKSUM: <id>` and exit 2 if the stored result has no checksum field.'''\nnew = '''4. Print `INTEGRITY_OK: <id>` and exit 0 if checksums match.\n5. Print `INTEGRITY_FAIL: <id>` and exit 1 if they differ.\n6. Print `NO_CHECKSUM: <id>` and exit 2 if the stored result has no checksum field.\n7. When `--verbose` is supplied, after the `INTEGRITY_OK` or `INTEGRITY_FAIL` line, also print:\n   - `Stored checksum: <hex>`\n   - `Computed checksum: <hex>`\n   Verbose mode does not change the exit code and does not apply to `NO_CHECKSUM`.'''\nif old not in s:\n    raise SystemExit('spec pattern not found')\ns = s.replace(old, new, 1)\np.write_text(s)\n\nq = Path('docs/legacy_api.md')\nt = q.read_text()\nt = t.replace('numeriforge verify <id> --store-dir <d"]
[3736.427318, "i", "ir>', 'numeriforge verify <id> --store-dir <dir> [--verbose]')\nt = t.replace('`VERIFIED:`', '`INTEGRITY_OK:`')\nt = t.replace('`CORRUPTED:`', '`INTEGRITY_FAIL:`')\nq.write_text(t)\nPY\n"]
[3736.427409, "o", "python3 - <<'PY'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
